HIVE patch v1 for @corebrum/core 0.8.16 (Corebrum Synapse 6f7b7840e2b3345f66412a0fb800f294cb94667c).
Fixes, for the rosbridge transport only: (1) request feedback when onFeedback is set,
(2) cancel by the goal's rosbridge id (caller may supply goalId), (3) pass GoalStatus through.

